{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single storey rear extension, due to the excessive size and inappropriate positioning directly on the property boundary, would harm the living conditions of neighbouring properties, in terms of loss of light, outlook, and increased sense of enclosure, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 and SC7 and the Residential Extension Guidelines.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed roof extensions, due to the excessive size and scale, and inappropriate position and design, would result in bulky and incongruous additions to the host property, unbalancing the pair of semi-detached houses, failing to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the site and the Osterley Park Conservation Area. This would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), CC4 (Heritage) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
  ],
